{"overview":"یک اسب تک‌شاخ نارنجی و جادویی که توانایی آواز خواندن دارد، گروه بازیگران خود را در بُعدی سورئال شبیه به یک برنامه تلویزیونی گروگان می‌گیرد. این اسب تک‌شاخ به مرور زمان رفتارهای عجیبی از خود نشان می‌دهد و فضای داستان را به سمت ناشناخته‌ها سوق می‌دهد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Inside the colorful world of \"It's Buddy!\", a group of children spend their days singing, dancing, and helping Buddy - bright orange unicorn - spread happiness. But when one child refuses to play along, Buddy is not pleased and cracks begin to appear in this seemingly perfect world.","tagline_en":"It's Buddy!","runtime":96,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Casper Kelly"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US","IL"],"cast":[{"name":"Delaney Quinn","role":"Freddy","photo":"/byBPP7Zg4NKQEejOBme9PUdRAZp.jpg"},{"name":"Caleb Williams","role":"Wade","photo":"/6I6wWh2dDYziQhqncAT0isaDGoY.jpg"},{"name":"Bennie Taylor","role":"Mailman Miles","photo":"/dFGThwEI8aGjqMSLHZQJ80sjmrm.jpg"},{"name":"اریک بائوزا","role":"Mr. Mailbox / Worry Well / Couchy / Trashy / Pee Flower (voice)","photo":"/lQl3CAkX5mY49bJUCGozO3wE6u1.jpg","en":"Eric Bauza"},{"name":"پتن اسوالت","role":"Strappy (voice)","photo":"/ljQvjbPmcIAl205Lb2Mu4CW8WO7.jpg","en":"Patton Oswalt"},{"name":"Sergey Zhuravsky","role":"Buddy (Suit)","photo":"/lHuBQY1GDuKWYhejOdmpTjKv9lO.jpg"},{"name":"کیگان-مایکل کی","role":"Buddy / Dark Buddy (voice)","photo":"/xmdzYXP9j87a43FSiL138nLesuS.jpg","en":"Keegan-Michael Key"},{"name":"Luke Speakman","role":"Josh","photo":"/lTngUURRsuiguNGzubZZhjNB86r.jpg"},{"name":"Cedwan Hooks","role":"Betty Bunny (Suit)","photo":"/lNBajAFFpCl3PqACQtFZF1mm57M.jpg"},{"name":"Jimmica Collins","role":"Betty Bunny / Scared Flower (voice)","photo":"/nWqwqhsLKj3bMjKNzdf38TpWg3v.jpg"},{"name":"Tristan Borders","role":"Oliver","photo":"/sSXJnfhtw8CbFJKRwd3cMEdhFAq.jpg"},{"name":"Phuong Kubacki","role":"Nurse Nancy","photo":"/uUgZ9EhaUJaxWhHoqPBZp3mGAhz.jpg"}],"trailer":"Pc9MbCNYn3k","watch":{"US":{"link